      ],
      "content": "BOVINGDON             \tWHELPLEY HILL TL 00 SW\t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                          6/56 -                        \t\t\tBarns at                                        \t\tBarton Colyers GV                                              II Barns.  C17  and  early  C19.  Timber  framed  C17  barn  with  dark weatherboarding and steep old red tile roofs, flint and brick lower barn parallel to road with old red tile roof. 2 barns joined at right angles. Older barn of 3-bays with rear aisle and gabled central porch facing S. Lower C19 barn facing E backing onto road. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0001903806"
    }
